        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gnomeageddon</strong> throws you out of bed and straight into absolute garden warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your once-perfect village is under siege… by gnomes. Not the cute kind—the relentless, time-warping, lawn-wrecking kind. And it’s all your fault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with nothing but your bow, you’ll fight off chaotic waves of enemies in this fast-paced, retro-inspired bullet hell. Dodge, shoot, and survive as the village turns into a battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between waves, dive through the world and space to rescue your scattered friends—each ready to help you hold the line. Find the very elixirs that caused this mess to give your bow a boost with wild, devastating effects… or just barely keep yourself alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your friends.<br>Save your village.<br>Smash Gnomes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Bullet Hell Combat</strong> – Fast, frantic, and unforgiving gnome-slaying action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rescue Missions</strong> – Search across familiar (but overrun) biomes to bring your friends home and power up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power up</strong>– Enhance your bow with explosive yet short lived, unpredictable effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Pixel Style</strong> – Classic top-down action with a vibrant, nostalgic look</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village won’t save itself.</p>",
